The map files in this directory are converted from Space Station 13 maps and
keep the terms of their sources.

cyberiad.map.ron is derived from _maps/map_files/Cyberiad/Cyberiad.dmm in
CorvaxStation (https://github.com/corvax-team/CorvaxStation) at commit
e032ad993ab81c6094a5ec0999b37494630cc08d, main floor only, by utils/ss13_import. CorvaxStation's
code, which its map files are part of, is licensed under the GNU Affero General
Public License v3 (see GPLv3.txt and LICENSE in that repository). The Cyberiad
layout itself descends from Paradise Station's Cyberiad (Box-derived), under the
same license family.

The sprites these maps place live under assets/textures and carry their own
attribution per sheet (CC BY-SA 3.0 for everything taken from CorvaxStation,
tgstation and Paradise)
